Licensing for raetha/zepp-wristwand
===================================

This repository uses different licences for different parts. The dividing
line: anything that could power someone else's paid watch app is
non-commercial; everything else is MIT.

1. MIT (see LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   - lib/            (generic helpers with no tie to watches: circular
                      statistics, summary statistics, a rate meter)
   - custom_components/wristwand/ and ha/
                     (the Home Assistant component, its tests and changelog)
   - tools/          (packaging, release, site and emulator scripts)
   - .github/        (CI configuration)
   - repository-level docs and config files (README.md, docs/, package.json, ...)

2. The WristWand watch app: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt)
   Everything inside watch/ - the watch app and its pointing, gesture and
   room-detection logic (watch/lib/), the side service, the settings page,
   the icon, screenshots and documentation - is licensed under Creative
   Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International.
   You may study, share and adapt it for non-commercial purposes, with credit,
   under the same licence. You may not sell it or a derivative of it, in any
   store.

3. Names and logos are not licensed
   The name "WristWand" and its icon are not licensed for reuse under either
   licence. Derivatives must use a different name.

The author (raetha) holds the copyright in all original material and may
distribute WristWand under other terms, including in paid app stores.

Copyright (c) 2026 raetha
